  <p>[ <a class="reference internal" href="../index.html#cli-aws"><span class="std std-ref">aws</span></a> . <a class="reference internal" href="index.html#cli-aws-sqs"><span class="std std-ref">sqs</span></a> ]</p>
<div class="section" id="get-queue-attributes">
<span id="cli-aws-sqs-get-queue-attributes"></span><h1>get-queue-attributes<a class="headerlink" href="#get-queue-attributes" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h1>
<div class="section" id="description">
<h2>Description<a class="headerlink" href="#description" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h2>
<p>Gets attributes for the specified queue.</p>
<div class="admonition note">
<h3 class='admonition-title'>Note</h3>To determine whether a queue is <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/FIFO-queues.html">FIFO</a> , you can check whether <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">QueueName</span></code> ends with the <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">.fifo</span></code> suffix.</div>
<p>See also: <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/goto/WebAPI/sqs-2012-11-05/GetQueueAttributes">AWS API Documentation</a></p>
</div>
<div class="section" id="synopsis">
<h2>Synopsis<a class="headerlink" href="#synopsis" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h2>
<div class="highlight-default notranslate"><div class="highlight"><pre><span></span>  <span class="n">get</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">queue</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">attributes</span>
<span class="o">--</span><span class="n">queue</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">url</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">value</span><span class="o">&gt;</span>
<span class="p">[</span><span class="o">--</span><span class="n">attribute</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">names</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">value</span><span class="o">&gt;</span><span class="p">]</span>
<span class="p">[</span><span class="o">--</span><span class="n">cli</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nb">input</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">json</span> <span class="o">|</span> <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">cli</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nb">input</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">yaml</span><span class="p">]</span>
<span class="p">[</span><span class="o">--</span><span class="n">generate</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">cli</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">skeleton</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">value</span><span class="o">&gt;</span><span class="p">]</span>
<span class="p">[</span><span class="o">--</span><span class="n">debug</span><span class="p">]</span>
